# Borescope Inspection Simulation (Isaac Sim)

Physics-based simulation of a borescope inspection through the HPC inspection port of a compressor model.
A jointed probe is inserted through the port and driven by acceleration commands through the borescope
kinematic model. A calibrated tip camera with an LED records the inspection, and the camera images, an IMU at
the probe tip and the ground-truth pose are published on ROS 2 for VIO / SLAM.

```
Acceleration input  ->  integration (box constraints)  ->  kinematic model h1  ->  joint targets
        ->  PhysX articulation in the engine  ->  tip camera + IMU + ground truth  ->  ROS 2
```

---

